# AT-HEIGHT (input cluster U1): a resize re-fits the @ picker. The window is
# kept where navigation left it and each frame paints the rows that keep the
# bar in view (paint_plan.zig:936-937); the next move scrolls by the rows that
# frame painted (app_render_runtime.zig:2357-2360, file_completion_state.zig:
# 248, :294). Launched at 40x120, shrunk to 16x120, grown back.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
work p5-input-at-height-ws
wait 4
type @f-
wait 1.5
key Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
wait 0.6
snap down12
resize 16x120
wait 1
snap short
key Up
wait 0.6
snap short-up1
key Up Up Up Up Up Up
wait 0.6
snap short-up7
resize 40x120
wait 1
snap tall
key Down
wait 0.6
snap tall-down1
